OL,5,
OL,6,FAikman, who plays Rachel Duffy in
OL,7,FLiverpool crime drama This City is
OL,8,FOurs, told Lucy Owen on BBC Radio Wales
OL,9,Fshe did not even tell her parents about
OL,10,Fher crucial role in the show.
